<Slide style={{width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '0px', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei'}}><Box style={{position: 'absolute', top: 0, left: 0, width: 1280, height: 72, background: '#1E4FA8'}}></Box><Box style={{position: 'absolute', top: 0, left: 0, width: 1280, height: 72, paddingLeft: 60, paddingRight: 60, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 28, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>过程⑤：覆盖门禁口径下的单一加权标量</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#C9DCF7', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>04 第二阶段 · 原理</Text></Box><Box style={{position: 'absolute', top: 88, left: 60, width: 1160, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 9}}><Box style={{width: 1160, background: '#F0F5FC', paddingLeft: 15, paddingRight: 15, paddingTop: 9, paddingBottom: 9, justifyContent: 'center'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.26, textAlign: 'left' }}>「完成是约束、成本是目标」写成构造性合法条件，而不是以收益最大化为主目标的字典序。</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 1160, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 10, justifyContent: 'center', gap: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 23, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>f(s) = W_hard·n_hard + w_exc·E_m + W_skip·n_skip + w_late·L_tot + λ·C_path　（最小化）</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.26, textAlign: 'left' }}>合法解上退化为 w_late·L_tot + λ·C_path 的单一加权标量；F1 对解无区分度，只作事后指标。</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 1160, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'stretch', gap: 12}}><Box style={{width: 278, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 12, gap: 8}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>T0 物理硬违约</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.26, textAlign: 'left' }}>W_hard = κ·m·R_pool 自动推导</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.3, textAlign: 'left' }}>任一次违约压倒任意交付收益——「纸面可行、执行弹回」的幽灵解永不入选；E_m 只在不可行解间做层内排序。</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 278, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 12, gap: 8}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>T0.5 覆盖门禁</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.26, textAlign: 'left' }}>voluntary_skip → 非法</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.3, textAlign: 'left' }}>「能装却没装」判非法；确实装不下记 capacity_shortfall，允许不交付。一阶可插判据不完备，不查「两个未覆盖任务拼班才装得下」，边界随 gate_stats 落盘。</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 278, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 12, gap: 8}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>T2 迟到（软）</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.26, textAlign: 'left' }}>w_late = 0.01 / 秒（exp01）</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.3, textAlign: 'left' }}>迟到可接受但不免费，与航程代价同层竞争；迟到交付仍计完成、计全额奖励，不淘汰任务。</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 278, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 12, gap: 8}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, textAlign: 'left' }}>T3 航程成本</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.26, textAlign: 'left' }}>λ·C_path 含返航（λ=0.1, exp01）</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.3, textAlign: 'left' }}>完成约束给定可行域上的最小化目标；航程含返巢代价，既承担防漂移又不另立 makespan / 负载均衡项。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{width: 1160, background: '#E8EFF8', padding: 13, gap: 6}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#0E3F8C', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.26, textAlign: 'left' }}>固定表述：搜索用 f 不含 −m·F1；F1 = Σ R_j·y_j 只作事后统计指标。</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.3, textAlign: 'left' }}>口径更正（相对旧 deck）：当前代码已移除「以交付收益最大化为第一目标的字典序」与 big-M 加权形式；lexicographic 类开关名是历史命名，F3 已整体移除。旧稿里的「四层准字典序 / −m·F1 / F3 = max T_u」不再使用。</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.26, textAlign: 'left' }}>权重数值取自实验配置（exp01：λ=0.1、w_violation=0.01）；类默认 lambda_cost=1.0、w_violation=None。每次落盘快照 fitness_weights，可独立重算对账。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{position: 'absolute', top: 670, left: 60, width: 1160, height: 30, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center'}}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#8B97A8', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.35, textAlign: 'left' }}>动态滚动的多机巢多无人机协同任务分配 · 方法讲解</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.35, textAlign: 'left' }}>16 / 19</Text></Box></Slide>